    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Goblins are creatures of the Feywild that embody recklessness and destruction. They love wreckage, and the louder, wilder and more convoluted it is, the better. A goblin raid is often as much an excuse to light fires and harass livestock as a step in some larger scheme. Goblins follow whoever pulls off the most outrageous plans, whether cunning raid leaders, flamboyant spellcasters or simply the noisiest among them. Hobgoblins and other domineering humanoids also take charge of unruly goblin bands, turning their destructive urges toward banditry, sabotage or war.</p><p>Goblin hexers wield showy, disruptive magic. Many of them are natural performers who dress and behave like exaggerated imitations of archmages.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
